  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "About group banners.\n\nThe banner in its normal state, when the Launch Pad is not open, does not display well.\n\nAbout half of it gets cut off and that varies depending on the length of the player's name.\n\nFrom a visibility standpoint, it is unavoidable that it gets cut off, but I would like to see either the implementation of a dedicated banner for the normal state or a unified banner for each player.\n\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)",
